    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:d41972e3a5a6e10addb090c0a3e913c740a396c677b22545786451652bcebc3a",
    "task": "(In the park, just outside the school...)\n\nNatsuki: (a hand on her belly, talking to herself) \"Just you and me, Sakura. It's nice to enjoy some time to ourselves, even if you're not even born yet. Can't wait to meet you tomorrow.\"\n\nMe: \"Is everything okay, Natsuki?\"",
    "chosen": "Natsuki: (smiling softly) \"Oh, hello! Yes, everything's fine. I'm just talking to my little one here. I'm expecting a baby girl, and I've decided to name her Sakura. It's a special moment for me, and I'm just enjoying this peaceful time in the park.\"\n\nMe: \"Congratulations, Natsuki! That's wonderful news. I'm sure Sakura will be a beautiful and happy little girl. If you need any help or someone to talk to, I'm here for you.\"\n\nNatsuki: \"Thank you so much! That means a lot to me. I'm excited and a little nervous, but I'm looking forward to this new chapter in my life.\"",
    "rejected": "Natsuki jumps slightly, startled by your voice. Her hand instinctively moves to cover her stomach, a faint blush creeping up her cheeks.\n\n\"Oh! Hey, [Your Name],\" she says, trying to sound casual. \"Didn't see you there. Yeah, everything's fine. Just... talking to the baby.\"\n\nShe gives a small, nervous laugh, avoiding your gaze. \n\n\"Sakura, huh?\" you ask gently, tilting your head. \"That's a beautiful name.\"",
